FlowState FPV — License for Use and Redistribution
Version 1.0 · 24 October 2026
Rights holder: YngwierFPV · https://github.com/YngwieRfpv

This license covers every file in this repository, in particular index.html,
tuner/index.html, guide/index.html and all files under assets/. It states what is
permitted with the programs. It is not legal advice.


Purpose

The license permits unmodified redistribution and prohibits modifications. The
reason is the write path: the tuner talks to the flight controller over Web
Serial. Unchecked forks or self-made changes should not carry potentially
dangerous errors into circulation and pass as a finished release nobody has
reviewed. The restriction serves safety and the integrity of the version history.


1. Use

The program may be opened, run and used unmodified — privately, at a club and in
commercial settings. Use is free of charge.


2. Redistribution

Unmodified and complete copies may be redistributed in any medium and by any
means, publicly and free of charge. Every redistribution must include this
license, the copyright notice and a reference to the original source:

    https://github.com/YngwieRfpv/flowstate-fpv-tuner

A link to this file is sufficient if it clearly names the original source.


3. No modification

Any change and any modification is prohibited, in particular:

    a) changes to source code, texts, images, layout or names,
    b) cuts, excerpts, partial copies or merging with other works,
    c) translations, renamings and other alterations,
    d) removing or altering copyright, license or source notices,
    e) redistributing results that are based on a modification.

Anyone who creates a modified version may not redistribute it. The right to
redistribute under section 2 applies to unmodified copies only.

Switching the language, switching the theme and operating the programs are not
modifications: they run inside the unmodified files.


4. Name and marks

The names FlowState, FlowState FPV, FlowState Tuner and FPV Guide and the
associated mark remain with the rights holder. Unmodified copies may contain
them. They may not be used for your own offerings, your own versions or as a
sender.


5. Third-party content

The FPV Guide contains third-party content, quotations, source references and
marks, in particular relating to Betaflight. Those contents remain under the
rights of their respective owners, independently of this license. The source and
license notices inside the document stay unchanged.


6. No warranty

The program is provided “as is”. No warranty is given for function, accuracy,
completeness or fitness for a particular purpose. Tuning and CLI writes change
flight controllers; mistakes can damage hardware or cause crashes. Check every
plan yourself, back up your setup first and fly only in a safe place.

To the extent permitted by law, the rights holder is not liable for damages
arising from the use or redistribution of the program.


7. Termination

Violations of this license terminate the right to redistribute under section 2
with immediate effect. Anyone who complies again may redistribute again.


8. Miscellaneous

If one provision of this license is invalid, the remaining license stays valid;
the invalid provision is replaced by the permitted rule closest to its purpose.
The law of the Federal Republic of Germany applies.

Only the rights holder may change this license, and only for future versions.
Copies already redistributed remain under the license they were distributed
under.
